{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 2, "text": "关于教育的重要性，布依族人民早已有所认识。谚云：“Faix miz mboongs miz ggoonl，", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 266, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "关于教育的重要性，布依族人民早已有所认识。谚云：“Faix miz mboongs miz ggoonl，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 266, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 3, "text": "wenz miz soonl miz rox”（意：树不钻不空，人不教不懂）；“Bux rox xih daab huat, bux", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 326, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "wenz miz soonl miz rox”（意：树不钻不空，人不教不懂）；“Bux rox xih daab huat, bux", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 326, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
