{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 6, "text": "而教育，必须从小抓起。谚云：“少小不学习，长大无出息。”“Gogt ndil byaail xih", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 523, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "而教育，必须从小抓起。谚云：“少小不学习，长大无出息。”“Gogt ndil byaail xih", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 523, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 7, "text": "ndil,gogt waaih byaail bil ndeeus ndeeus”（根好梢就好，根坏巅摇摆）。除从小就抓起，既", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 587, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "ndil,gogt waaih byaail bil ndeeus ndeeus”（根好梢就好，根坏巅摇摆）。除从小就抓起，既", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 587, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 8, "text": "包括智育方面。也包括德育方面，所谓“小时不育，大来育不伸”就是指教育就像栽培树", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 648, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "包括智育方面。也包括德育方面，所谓“小时不育，大来育不伸”就是指教育就像栽培树", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 648, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 9, "text": "木：幼小时如发现长弯了就必须扳直，否则长大后就扳不直了。教育也是这样，小时出现", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "木：幼小时如发现长弯了就必须扳直，否则长大后就扳不直了。教育也是这样，小时出现", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 712, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 10, "text": "的不良习气如不予纠正，长大要改就很难了。有的谚语规定儿童的行为准则：“小人脾气", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 781, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的不良习气如不予纠正，长大要改就很难了。有的谚语规定儿童的行为准则：“小人脾气", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 781, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 11, "text": "惯不得，扯谎扯不得，害人的事做不得。“除从小就培养儿童良好的道德品质外，还必须具", "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 830, "w": 1545, "h": 80}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "惯不得，扯谎扯不得，害人的事做不得。“除从小就培养儿童良好的道德品质外，还必须具", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 830, "w": 1545, "h": 80}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 12, "text": "备一定的生产技能和社会生活常识。而这些也必须从小抓起。例如布依族对女儿的教", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 909, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "备一定的生产技能和社会生活常识。而这些也必须从小抓起。例如布依族对女儿的教", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 909, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 13, "text": "育，谚云说：“五岁学搓麻，七岁学纺纱，九岁下地种棉花，自己穿着不能做，不准到婆家。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 974, "w": 1536, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "育，谚云说：“五岁学搓麻，七岁学纺纱，九岁下地种棉花，自己穿着不能做，不准到婆家。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 974, "w": 1536, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 14, "text": "布依族特别重视家庭教育。谚云：“Boh gvaail leg xih gvaail, aail ndil lauc xih hans”", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1038, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族特别重视家庭教育。谚云：“Boh gvaail leg xih gvaail, aail ndil lauc xih hans”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1038, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 15, "text": "（老子聪明儿智慧，糟好酒才醇）。这里的“聪明”、“智慧”不是遗传学或血统论意义上", "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1096, "w": 1540, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（老子聪明儿智慧，糟好酒才醇）。这里的“聪明”、“智慧”不是遗传学或血统论意义上", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1096, "w": 1540, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 16, "text": "的，而是说教育得好。谚又云：“牛吃牛背，马吃马驮；自家儿女，自家教说。”这是说，父母", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1167, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的，而是说教育得好。谚又云：“牛吃牛背，马吃马驮；自家儿女，自家教说。”这是说，父母", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1167, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 17, "text": "对子女的教育是一种不可推卸的职责。在布依族的家庭教育中，因男女社会分工的不", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1235, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "对子女的教育是一种不可推卸的职责。在布依族的家庭教育中，因男女社会分工的不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1235, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 18, "text": "同，所以主张对男孩和女孩的教育分别由父亲和母亲来承担。谚云：“Legsaail miz soonl", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1300, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "同，所以主张对男孩和女孩的教育分别由父亲和母亲来承担。谚云：“Legsaail miz soonl", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1300, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 19, "text": "ggvaais boh,legmbegt miz soonl gvaais meeh”（男儿不教父之错，女儿不教母之过）。又云：", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1364, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "ggvaais boh,legmbegt miz soonl gvaais meeh”（男儿不教父之错，女儿不教母之过）。又云：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1364, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
