{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 23, "text": "出嫁骂公婆。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1617, "w": 259, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "出嫁骂公婆。”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 100, "y": 1617, "w": 259, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 24, "text": "家庭教育没搞好，往往受到社会的非议。这实际上是一种社会教育形式，人们根据", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1690, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家庭教育没搞好，往往受到社会的非议。这实际上是一种社会教育形式，人们根据", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1690, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 25, "text": "社会的道德观对其进行纠正。“Leg rox soonl jauchos,leg miz rox soonl doh beangz”（懂事", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "社会的道德观对其进行纠正。“Leg rox soonl jauchos,leg miz rox soonl doh beangz”（懂事", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
