{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 422, "line_no": 30, "text": "仿效来进行学习，正如谚语所说：“Leg danc haaiz boh, baex aul wens meeh”（儿穿父鞋，媳", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2076, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "仿效来进行学习，正如谚语所说：“Leg danc haaiz boh, baex aul wens meeh”（儿穿父鞋，媳", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2076, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
